# Rakdos, Patron of Chaos: only nonland, nontoken permanents count toward the two to sacrifice. On turn 3 Bot2 controls Plains, a Thraben
# Inspector and the Clue token it made: two nonland permanents but only one nontoken, so Bot2 cannot pay and is not asked; Bot1 draws two
# cards (5 in hand at turn 3's main phase, 7 after) and Bot2 keeps everything. The sibling scenario with two Memnites is the positive control.

